# Data Governance Statement (CARE)

This project applies the
[CARE Principles for Indigenous Data Governance](https://www.gida-global.org/care)
— Collective Benefit, Authority to Control, Ethics, and Relationship —
alongside FAIR, so that the people behind the data remain visible.

