## Collective Benefit

How does the use of this data deliver benefit to the communities the data
is about?

## Authority to Control

Who holds the rights and consent authority over this data? How are those
communities represented in decisions about access and reuse?

## Ethics

What power imbalances and ethical risks surround this data? Which
community values and review processes apply?

## Relationship

How are the relationships with the data-sharing communities maintained
over the project's lifetime?

## Traceability & provenance

Under CARE, the people behind the data can always ask: where did this
data come from, who holds it now, and what was done with it. The answers
are recorded here and kept up to date.

| Dataset | Origin | Consent / authority basis | Steward | External copies |
