Every external transfer follows `sharing/DATA_TRANSFER_AGREEMENT.md` and
is recorded in `sharing/TRANSFER_LOG.csv` — with purpose, recipient,
agreement reference, dataset fingerprint and the person who authorised
it — **before** the data ships. Deletion is confirmed in writing at the
end of the term, and the steward reports back to the data-sharing
community on the agreed cadence (Authority to Control, Relationship).
